cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "MotionGate: Motion-Gated Person Detection with Bounded Staleness"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Osinchuk
    given-names: Yana
version: 1.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/yanaosinchuk/motiongate"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  A typed Python implementation of motion-gated person detection with bounded
  detection staleness, rate-limited scheduling, stabilized frame differencing,
  reproducible benchmarking, and an optional sparse optical-flow tracker.
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - person detection
  - motion detection
  - object detection
  - optical flow
  - video analytics
  - OpenCV
  - YOLO
